---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const canonicalUrl = 'https://calcumetrics.com/disclaimer';
---
<Layout title="Disclaimer | Calcumetrics" description="Calcumetrics provides financial calculators for information only. Results are not financial, tax, or legal advice." canonical={canonicalUrl}>
  <div class="max-w-[700px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <p class="text-xs text-text-muted mb-2">Last updated: 20 September 2026</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-text-primary mb-6">Disclaimer</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">The calculators on this website are provided for informational and educational purposes only. They are not financial, tax, investment, or legal advice.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">Results are estimates</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">All outputs are calculated from the inputs you provide and the stated mathematical formulas. They assume constant rates and stated conventions for the entire projection period. Actual returns, interest rates, tax obligations, and financial outcomes will differ from these estimates.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">Returns are not guaranteed</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Investment calculator results (SIP, lump sum, CAGR, XIRR, etc.) assume a constant annual rate that is chosen by you. Past performance of any fund or asset class is not indicative of future returns. Market investments carry risk, including the risk of loss of principal.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">Tax and regulatory rates change</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Tax calculator results are based on rates verified as of the date shown on each tool. Tax laws, rates, and slabs change. Verify the applicable rates from official government sources before filing or making tax-related decisions.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">Consult a professional</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">Before making any significant financial, investment, tax, or legal decision, consult a qualified professional such as a Chartered Accountant (CA), Certified Financial Planner (CFP), or solicitor licensed in your jurisdiction.</p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-text-primary mt-8 mb-3">Third-party links</h2>
      <p class="text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">Links to official sources (government websites, regulators) are provided for convenience. We do not control and are not responsible for the content of external sites.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
